// The boathouse, Melos, ground floor (design/phase4/SCRIPT.md, Part 2): Myrtis
// and Kalchedon, fishers, and their baby live in the room over their boat
// (Melos_BoathouseLoft, up the stair at (9,2)). Down here the boat sits on its
// slip and the sea comes in under the painted doors (the water at (6..10,6..7)).
// Room: tools/ichor/maps/kythera_homes.py. The street door's mat is (2..3,7).
//
// TODO(act3): exit to MAP_MELOS (one of Klima's boathouses at the waterline).

mapscripts Melos_Boathouse_MapScripts {}

script Melos_Boathouse_EventScript_Boat {
    msgbox(format("Their boat, hauled up on rollers on the stone slip."), MSGBOX_SIGN)
}

script Melos_Boathouse_EventScript_SeaDoors {
    msgbox(format("The sea comes in under the painted doors."), MSGBOX_SIGN)
}
